    "sections": {
        "description": "The Organic Gardening Theme is a beautifully crafted, eco-friendly and versatile solution designed for gardening companies, landscapers, horticulturists, florists, home gardening enthusiasts and sustainable agriculture consultants. It supports organic, sustainable, regenerative, urban, rooftop, balcony, container and hydroponic gardening practices with a modern responsive layout. Ideal for growing vegetables, flowers and herbs, it also highlights natural irrigation systems, composting, soil care and pest control methods. This flexible platform suits gardening blogs, eco plant stores, farming startups and landscaping services. With SEO-friendly structure and fast performance, it improves visibility across devices. Built-in customization, social sharing and gallery tools make content easy to manage, while inquiry forms support lead generation and customer engagement. It also enables selling plants, seeds and gardening supplies, helping promote eco-conscious and climate-resilient gardening lifestyles for sustainable growth solutions"
    },
